  prefabStrategy: Dedicated backline prefab using Spikarian plus missile launcher;
    turret presentation is not mixed into this soldier.
  animationRead: Missile-launcher humanoid clips are promoted for long hold, shot,
    crouch retreat, hit, and death reads. Missile-launcher common humanoid set for
    long windup, retreat shot, and line pressure.
  vfxRead: RetreatShot and LinePressure cues sell a slower backline threat without
    pretending it is a fixed turret.
  reuseJustification: Candidate keeps role behavior in data so the same pattern/deck
    contract can be reused by future summon AI.
